<title>SPAIN: Spain joblessness rises to 13.82 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Spain joblessness rises to 13.82 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	     SEPT 96     AUG 96	SEPT 95</p>
<p> Total (million)		2.19	   2.14	 2.38</p>
<p> Change on month	  +51.106	-27,006    +37,820</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	  13.82	  13.50	15.32</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
